'''Amalgam Daikyu Target Acquired '''is an Amalgam mod exclusive to the {{Weapon|Daikyu}} and {{Weapon|Daikyu Prime}}. It provides an increased [[Enemy Body Parts|headshot]] multiplier, [[Life Steal]] when using [[Nikanas]], and a chance to gather used arrows.

