==Drop Locations==
{{DropLocations}}

==Notes==
*With this mod equipped, arrows stuck in enemies or on surfaces can sometimes be picked up when physically touched, along with a unique sound upon pickup. Multiple arrows fired from [[multishot]] may also be picked up, occasionally refunding more ammo than what was expended.
*Since headshots normally reward 3.0x damage, this mod will increase that to 5.25x damage. This is further increased with {{Arcane|Primary Deadhead}} for a total headshot damage multiplier of 6.15x.
*Not [[Trading|tradeable]].
*The life steal granted to [[Nikana (Weapon Type)|Nikanas]] applies to all of their attacks, including the projectile heavy attack of {{Weapon|Syam}}.
**Damage ticks from status effects do not result in life steal. 
**Lifesteal does not apply to [[Two-Handed Nikana]]s, [[Dual Nikanas]], or [[Exalted Blade]].
**Lifesteal does not interact with {{M|Archon Intensify}}.

==Tips==
*The mod can synergize very well with {{WF|Ivara}}'s {{A|Prowl}} ability as that also has innate bonus damage to headshots, and the Daikyu is innately silent.

